<!--tz-meta {"id":"ruby-nonprofit","title":"Kawa River Trust — river cleanup nonprofit","category":"Ruby","file":"ruby/nonprofit.html.erb","tags":["ruby","erb","nonprofit","environment"],"description":"Ma-japanese nonprofit page for fictional Kawa River Trust: vast whitespace, a single vertical hairline with a red hanko circle, sparse program rows.","dnas":["ma-japanese"]} -->
<% bg = "#f7f4ec" %>
<% ink = "#26221c" %>
<% accent = "#a33327" %>
<% muted = "#8a8478" %>
<% line = "#26221c1f" %>
<% surface = "#efe9da" %>
<% display = "Shippori Mincho" %>
<% body = "Zen Kaku Gothic New" %>
<% mono = "Space Mono" %>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Kawa River Trust — the river, kept</title>
<meta name="description" content="Kawa River Trust is a volunteer nonprofit restoring the Kawa River: cleanups, native planting, and water testing. Join a Saturday.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Shippori+Mincho:wght@400;600;700&family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@400;500;700&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:<%= bg %>; --ink:<%= ink %>; --accent:<%= accent %>;
  --muted:<%= muted %>; --line:<%= line %>; --surface:<%= surface %>;
  --ink-2:color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 70%, var(--bg));
  --display:"<%= display %>",serif;
  --body:"<%= body %>",-apple-system,sans-serif;
  --mono:"<%= mono %>",ui-monospace,monospace;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body);
     font-size:16.5px;line-height:2;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
::selection{background:var(--accent);color:var(--bg)}
.wrap{max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,5vw,56px)}
/* the page's one distinctive choice: a single vertical hairline with a hanko circle */
.spine{position:fixed;top:0;bottom:0;left:clamp(12px,4vw,48px);width:1px;background:var(--line);z-index:0}
.hanko{position:fixed;top:120px;left:clamp(12px,4vw,48px);width:44px;height:44px;
       transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(4deg);border:3px solid var(--accent);border-radius:50%;
       display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:1;background:var(--bg)}
.hanko span{font-family:var(--display);font-size:20px;color:var(--accent);line-height:1}
/* header */
header{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:34px 0}
header .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline}
.wordmark{font-family:var(--display);font-size:22px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}
header nav{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em}
header nav a{color:var(--ink-2);text-decoration:none;margin-left:26px;text-transform:uppercase}
header nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
/* hero: vast space, one statement */
.hero{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:clamp(90px,14vw,190px) 0 clamp(70px,10vw,140px)}
.hero .kicker{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;
              color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:34px}
h1{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,88px);
   line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:.01em;margin-bottom:40px;max-width:16ch}
h1 .red{color:var(--accent)}
.hero p{font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-2);max-width:52ch}
/* statement section */
.statement{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:clamp(70px,10vw,140px) 0}
.statement p.big{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,42px);line-height:1.7;
                 max-width:26ch}
.statement p.small{margin-top:36px;font-size:15.5px;color:var(--ink-2);max-width:56ch}
/* programs: sparse rows, generous air */
.programs{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:clamp(40px,6vw,80px) 0 clamp(70px,10vw,130px)}
.programs h2{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;
             color:var(--ink-2);font-weight:400;margin-bottom:12px}
.prog{padding:44px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:baseline}
.prog:last-of-type{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.prog h3{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);font-weight:600}
.prog .when{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.12em;
            text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:8px}
.prog p{color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15.5px;max-width:44ch}
/* numbers, quiet */
.numbers{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:0 0 clamp(70px,10vw,130px)}
.numbers .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}
.numbers .cell{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:18px}
.numbers .n{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,64px);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.1}
.numbers .l{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;
            color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:8px}
/* join */
.join{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:clamp(70px,10vw,140px) 0;text-align:left;
      border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.join h2{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(38px,5.6vw,68px);font-weight:400;
         line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:28px;max-width:18ch}
.join p{color:var(--ink-2);max-width:54ch;margin-bottom:36px}
.btn{display:inline-block;border:2px solid var(--ink);color:var(--ink);font-weight:700;
     font-size:15px;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:3px;text-decoration:none;margin-right:16px}
.btn:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
.btn.solid{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--bg)}
.btn.solid:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);color:var(--bg)}
.join .note{margin-top:28px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-2)}
/* footer */
footer{position:relative;z-index:2;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;
             padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:40px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-2)}
footer a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}
footer a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
@media (max-width:700px){
  .prog{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}
  .numbers .row{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .btn{margin-bottom:12px}
  .spine{left:10px}.hanko{left:10px;width:36px;height:36px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="spine" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="hanko" aria-hidden="true"><span>川</span></div>

<header><div class="wrap">
  <a class="wordmark" href="#">Kawa River Trust</a>
  <nav><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#join">Join</a><a href="#donate">Donate</a></nav>
</div></header>

<main>
<div class="wrap hero">
  <p class="kicker">A volunteer nonprofit · since 2011</p>
  <h1>The river, <span class="red">kept.</span></h1>
  <p>We are neighbors who decided the Kawa deserved better than shopping carts and
  runoff. Fifteen years later, the herons are back. The work isn't finished.</p>
</div>

<div class="wrap statement">
  <p class="big">A river is not scenery. It is the longest conversation a town has with itself.</p>
  <p class="small">Every month we test the water at eleven points along the Kawa, publish
  the results whether they're flattering or not, and spend one Saturday a month doing
  the unglamorous work: hauling tires, planting sedge, counting what swims back.</p>
</div>

<div class="wrap programs" id="work">
  <h2>The work</h2>
  <div class="prog">
    <div><h3>Cleanups</h3><p class="when">First Saturday · 9 AM · rain or shine</p></div>
    <p>Gloves, bags, and coffee provided. We split into crews by reach — families take
    the meadow stretch, the brave take the culvert. 2,140 bags hauled since 2011.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="prog">
    <div><h3>Native planting</h3><p class="when">April &amp; October</p></div>
    <p>Sedge, willow, and buttonbush where the banks were bare. Roots hold the soil;
    shade cools the water; shade brings back the trout.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="prog">
    <div><h3>Water testing</h3><p class="when">Monthly · open data</p></div>
    <p>Volunteers sample eleven sites for nitrates, phosphates, and turbidity. Every
    reading is published — the river's report card, no curve.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap numbers">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="cell"><div class="n">2,140</div><div class="l">bags of debris removed</div></div>
    <div class="cell"><div class="n">11</div><div class="l">water testing sites</div></div>
    <div class="cell"><div class="n">380</div><div class="l">regular volunteers</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap join" id="join">
  <h2>Come to a Saturday.<br>Bring boots.</h2>
  <p>No experience needed, no dues, no speeches. Show up at the Depot Street bridge
  at 9 a.m. on the first Saturday of the month and we'll hand you gloves. If you'd
  rather fund the work than do it, $25 buys a water test kit.</p>
  <a class="btn solid" href="#join" id="donate">Donate $25</a>
  <a class="btn" href="#join">Join a cleanup</a>
  <p class="note">Kawa River Trust is a 501(c)(3). EIN 04-5550147 · donations are tax-deductible.</p>
</div>
</main>

<footer><div class="wrap">
  <span>© 2026 Kawa River Trust · The river thanks you, quietly</span>
  <span><a href="#">Water data</a> · <a href="#">Newsletter</a> · <a href="mailto:hello@kawariver.example">hello@kawariver.example</a></span>
</div></footer>
</body>
</html>
